OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after cyclist fatally
OL,4,Ahurt in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after a
OL,7,F16-year-old cyclist died following a
OL,8,Fcollision in Birmingham.
OL,10,FThe teenager was found with serious
OL,11,Finjuries on Friday close to the
OL,12,Fjunction of Cattell Road and
OL,13,FTemplefield Street in the Small Heath
OL,14,Farea, near Birmingham City's stadium.
OL,16,FHe was taken to hospital but died on
OL,17,FSaturday, West Midlands Police said.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
