OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after cyclist fatally
OL,4,Ahurt in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FClyde Carey, 47, appeared earlier
OL,7,Fbefore city magistrates charged with
OL,8,Fcausing death by dangerous driving,
OL,9,Ffailing to stop at the scene and
OL,10,Fcausing death while uninsured, the
OL,11,Fforce said.
